458
00:32:37.720 --> 00:32:40.155
Sure. You folks want one room or--

459
00:32:40.240 --> 00:32:41.230
Two.

460
00:32:44.080 --> 00:32:45.514
Two. Two.

461
00:32:48.160 --> 00:32:50.879
Well, yeah.
I can put him in the garage if you want.

462
00:32:50.960 --> 00:32:52.678
All right, two rooms will be fine.

463
00:32:52.760 --> 00:32:55.513
Just giving you options.
Okay, right this way.

464
00:33:36.440 --> 00:33:39.512
Sniper. Rooftop.
