508
00:43:18.000 --> 00:43:19.354
Maybe a G?

509
00:43:21.320 --> 00:43:22.993
Taking someone's Gulfstream?

510
00:43:23.120 --> 00:43:26.033
I mean, you'd really have to love a guy
to do that.

511
00:43:28.280 --> 00:43:30.271
I knowjust the feller. Give me a minute.

512
00:44:04.640 --> 00:44:05.675
Henry?

513
